  "notes": "Needs MIDI FLT > CTRL CHG = ENABLE. CC numbers are the factory CC MAP (GLOBAL > CC MAP can change them). CCs act on the timbre of their channel: timbre 1 on the global channel, timbre 2 on T2MIDI.CH in MULTI mode. NRPNs (arp, voice mode, vocoder, virtual patch) go to the global channel and use only the Data Entry MSB. Values from the German manual's MIDI chapter, untested. Source and destination are NRPN (MSB 4, LSB 0–5 and 8–13), intensity is a centred CC.",
